# Path components that must never be tracked in this public repository.
# One name per line. A tracked path is refused when ANY of its components
# equals a name here, compared case-insensitively, at any depth.
# Read by scripts/workspace-guard.mjs, which the pre-commit hook and CI
# both run. Keep it in step with the agent-workspace block of .gitignore.
.agents
.claude
CLAUDE.md
governance
STICKIES.md
SESSION_HANDOFF.md
METHODOLOGY.md
API_AUDIT.md
